{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-2554691","kind":"blog","title":"【日记】2016年八丈岛美味再现","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-04-04","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 再現！","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-2554691/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"把八丈岛带回来的美味一一复现，蛋黄酱配海苔、酸奶饮料，还有意外变成惩罚游戏的明日叶啤酒！","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","食べもの飲みもの"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · 再現！","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2554691.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160408084018id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2554691.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"在八丈岛吃喝过\n觉得美味的东西\n想要把它们\n再现出来！\n给自己的奖励（笑）\n<br>\n<br>\n没错！\n\n伴手礼！！！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/001-30f1f80fd0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/001-30f1f80fd0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n<br>\n啊！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/002-38602f5cc2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/002-38602f5cc2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n喂喂！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/003-80c75c7d64.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/003-80c75c7d64.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n海苔\n连奇奇也满怀兴趣！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n3种海苔，还有……\n据说很适合搭配海苔的\n就是这个！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/004-9c5e149371.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/004-9c5e149371.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n把这个\n和蛋黄酱搭配起来\n据说这样吃海苔很美味！（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n另外\n还有让我无比感动的\n八丈岛酸奶饮料！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/005-433fc3a3c2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/005-433fc3a3c2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n清爽又美味\n甜甜的，棒极了！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                去八丈岛的话\n一定要喝喝看！\n是极品！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n我无论如何\n都想做出来的\n就是明日叶啤酒！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n机场里有明日叶粉末\n所以我买来试试（笑）\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/006-c861ee76ea.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/006-c861ee76ea.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n马上\n试着做做看！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n明日叶粉末 vs Super Dry！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/007-4faf22e115.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/007-4faf22e115.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                    先来\n                \n放入粉末……\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/008-4f9e33a5bf.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/008-4f9e33a5bf.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n倒入啤酒！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n咦？！\n\n<br>\n\n\n怎么回事？？？！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n倒入啤酒！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/010-2c9e8b6173.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/010-2c9e8b6173.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n哇——！！\n这是什么啊？！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n这已经\n变成一杯看起来很可怕的饮料了……\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n嗯\n也许是那个吧\n\n<br>\n\n\n看起来和喝起来不一样的\n那个吧\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n豁出去\n喝一口看看！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/011-a42711f4a7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/011-a42711f4a7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n嗯？？\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/012-89fb7c61fc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/012-89fb7c61fc.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n嗯、嗯嗯嗯？？？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/013-b6978e2a50.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/013-b6978e2a50.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n哇！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n果然\n太难喝了！！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n完全就是\n明日叶和\n啤酒分离开来的味道！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n这\n完全就是惩罚游戏嘛（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（下回预告）\n\n<br>\n\n\n明日叶粉末 vs 顶级麦芽啤酒！\n敬请期待！（笑）\n\n<br>","markdown_ja":"八丈島で飲んで食べて\n美味しかったものを\n再現したく！\n自分へのご褒美（笑）\n<br>\n<br>\nそう！\nお土産！！！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/001-30f1f80fd0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/001-30f1f80fd0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n<br>\nあっ！\n<br>\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/002-38602f5cc2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/002-38602f5cc2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"1136\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこらこら！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/003-80c75c7d64.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/003-80c75c7d64.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n海苔に\nキキも興味津々！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n3つの海苔と・・\n海苔に合うという\nこちら！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/004-9c5e149371.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/004-9c5e149371.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nこれに\nマヨネーズを合わせて\n海苔を食べるとウマい！って\n書いてあった（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nあと\nものすごく感動した\n八丈島のヨーグルトドリンク！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/005-433fc3a3c2.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/005-433fc3a3c2.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさらっと美味しく\n甘くて最高！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n                八丈島に行ったら\n必ず飲んで欲しい！\n絶品です！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nどーしても\n作りたいと思ったのが\nあしたばビール！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n粉末が空港にあったので\n買ってみた（笑）\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/006-c861ee76ea.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/006-c861ee76ea.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさっそく\n作ってみたよ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nあしたば粉末 vs スーパードライ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/007-4faf22e115.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/007-4faf22e115.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n                    まずは\n                \n粉を入れて・・・\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/008-4f9e33a5bf.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/008-4f9e33a5bf.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nビールを注ぐ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nええ？！\n\n<br>\n\n\nあれ？？？！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nビールを注ぐ！\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/010-2c9e8b6173.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/010-2c9e8b6173.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nぐわー！！\nこれなんだ？！！\n\n<br>\n\n\nすでに\n恐ろしげな飲み物に・・・\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nまあ\nあれか\n\n<br>\n\n\n見た目と味は違うという\nあれか\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n思い切って\n飲んでみる！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/011-a42711f4a7.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/011-a42711f4a7.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nん？？\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/012-89fb7c61fc.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/012-89fb7c61fc.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nんっんんんっ？？？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/013-b6978e2a50.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2554691/013-b6978e2a50.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nうわっっ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nやっぱり\nまずいっ！！！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n完全に\nあしたばと\nビールが分離した味！！\n\n<br>\n\n\nこれ\n完全に罰ゲームじゃん（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（次回予告）\n\n<br>\n\n\nあしたば粉末 vs プレミアムモルツ！\nお楽しみに！（笑）\n\n<br>"}}